{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2020-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1599523200, "end_date": 1600214399, "month_true_total": 227, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:02 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "76042917", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971628109", "personaname": "Xesin Is Dul", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/XesinIsDul/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 4147, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 866, "last_played": 1603640699, "avatar": "61abd4a8b8c30a27894ccdbf0cf906c9328c34a7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Wow....", "timestamp_created": 1600212013, "timestamp_updated": 1600212013, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492700725793838501", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76039977", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202083336", "personaname": "Joseph", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Josephexe/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4877, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1532, "last_played": 1624922163, "avatar": "708f6b5ad89536cdd54cca18002412ffc0b54a8e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Crashes every 2 ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ minutes", "timestamp_created": 1600206812, "timestamp_updated": 1600206812, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76035557", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981365290", "personaname": "jashin01", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bigpapa13/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3021, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2617, "last_played": 1600222937, "avatar": "5c5fe7c44f75846bbee98e6bdb6a0c5203727ea0"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like a lot of long cinematic transitions, and I do mean a lot.  Then this game is for you.  For every little quest that requires you to go to 3 different planets you can expect at least 3 minutes of transition sequences and it gets tedious.  Like really really tedious.  Aside from that I'm still playing it.  I like the story and the gameplay.  I really hate the transitions though.", "timestamp_created": 1600200054, "timestamp_updated": 1600200054, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76031036", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143944972", "personaname": "RainyPrai", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RainyPrai/", "num_games_owned": 570, "num_reviews": 106, "playtime_forever": 67, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 67, "last_played": 1600188764, "avatar": "ed8500c6e5ea1e19c880ed2dea2ab5cb31ad5c32"}, "language": "english", "review": "its like if someone took my femur and then ate it infront of me", "timestamp_created": 1600193659, "timestamp_updated": 1600193659, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.410583913326263428", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "76024748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052259491", "personaname": "gunnerarchangel2k12", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/archangel2k12/", "num_games_owned": 322, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 4331, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4326, "last_played": 1600185941, "avatar": "0bfd6a007df7f197f6b622848c60547bc3e611a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am a huge fan of bioware games, and though they aren't exactly what they used to be, They are still making games that I can enjoy.  This one had a terrible launch.  I avoided it for the last few years and finally gave it a shot.  I have played the ME trilogy several times through.  This game is not as good, but at this point in it's updates, it is still a very good game.  \nStrengths: Combat is very fun.  The supporting cast is actually good, just not as good as the trilogy.  Driving the NOMAD (ground vehicle) is super fun.  Upgrading weapons and armor is a good system.  Story/side stories are usually gratifying.  This game has a more lighthearted tone.\nWeakness: the dialogue is usually bad, as are the facial animations.  At parts of the game, there is WAY too much \"fly to this planet, talk to a guy, fly to another planet, talk to someone else, then fly another place and drive to the end of the map\" to complete the quest series.  \nI DO recommend this game to people who love the Bioware formula and are willing to give it a fresh chance.", "timestamp_created": 1600185682, "timestamp_updated": 1600185682, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}